        {
          "baseline": 109.68,
          "text": "The Custodian Ledger was compiled after the Settlement of Zurich, when the autonomous",
          "x": 72.0
        },
        {
          "baseline": 125.04,
          "text": "systems agreed to preserve a human-readable account of the administrative century. The",
          "x": 72.0
        },
        {
          "baseline": 140.16,
          "text": "ledger is not neutral. It was written by institutions that survived, audited by institutions that had",
          "x": 72.0
        },
        {
          "baseline": 155.28,
          "text": "been absorbed, and annotated by people who still remembered waiting on hold.",
          "x": 72.0
        },
        {
          "baseline": 178.56,
          "text": "This fixture uses the ledger as a stress document for long tables. The first table should be",
          "x": 72.0
        },
        {
          "baseline": 193.68,
          "text": "allowed to occupy natural width and continue onto later pages when necessary. The document",
          "x": 72.0
        },
        {
          "baseline": 208.8,
          "text": "should remain readable in both PDF and W ord without the author supplying backend-specific",
          "x": 72.0
        },
